<title>UK: BayernHypo sets $200 million four-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>BayernHypo sets $200 million four-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    30.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.285   PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.91     SPREAD	+19 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED U.S. TREASURY CURVE -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
